{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1182957-dixie-cochran-yet-another-changeling-developer-no-dixie-is-rose-s-replacement-as-cofd-lead-and-already-edited-ctl2-before-the-ks-ctl2-development-remains-a-rose-and-meghan-project","id":1182957,"title":"Dixie Cochran: Yet another Changeling Developer [No. Dixie is Rose's replacement as CofD lead and already edited CtL2 before the KS, CtL2 development remains a Rose and Meghan project.]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-06T09:40:02-08:00","id":1182957,"title":"Dixie Cochran: Yet another Changeling Developer [No. Dixie is Rose's replacement as CofD lead and already edited CtL2 before the KS, CtL2 development remains a Rose and Meghan project.]","content":"Okay, it appears Rose Bailey is moving on to new opportunities, and is being replaced by Dixie Cochran. <br /> <br /> It's a bit confusing, is Dixie Cochran a new co-developer for Changeling with Meghan Fitzgerald? <br /> <br /> So far we have had David Hill, Rose Bailey, Meghan Fitzgerald, and now possibly Dixie Cochran as head developers for Changeling. <br /> <br /> How does this effect Changeling going forward?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T09:42:32-08:00","id":1182959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/16886863.Dixie_Cochran\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://s.gr-assets.com/assets/nophoto/user/u_700x933-9d85205e45c8c5b42bde388f589bd0cf.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/16886863.Dixie_Cochran\" target=\"_blank\"> Dixie Cochran </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/16886863.Dixie_Cochran\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/16886863.Dixie_Cochran </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Author of Pirates of Pugmire, Trinity Continuum, and Exalted </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> So she's a developer for Changeling the Dreaming?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T09:49:01-08:00","id":1182962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1182957-dixie-cochran-yet-another-changeling-developer-no-dixie-is-rose-s-replacement-as-cofd-lead-and-already-edited-ctl2-before-the-ks-ctl2-development-remains-a-rose-and-meghan-project#post1182957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, it appears Rose Bailey is moving on to new opportunities, and is being replaced by Dixie Cochran.<br /> <br /> It's a bit confusing, is Dixie Cochran a new co-developer for Changeling with Meghan Fitzgerald?<br /> <br /> So far we have had David Hill, Rose Bailey, Meghan Fitzgerald, and now possibly Dixie Cochran as head developers for Changeling.<br /> <br /> How does this effect Changeling going forward?</div> </div> </div> </div>Meghan Fitzgerald is still the Changeling: the Lost 2e developer. Rose and Meghan worked together to get the 2e core moving along and through the Kickstarter and now Meghan will continue as developer. Dixie will continue to work as editor and she is picking up some management side coordinating and high level CofD organizational duties.<br /> <br /> -M<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-06T11:53:00-08:00","id":1183003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt-M-McElroy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1182957-dixie-cochran-yet-another-changeling-developer-no-dixie-is-rose-s-replacement-as-cofd-lead-and-already-edited-ctl2-before-the-ks-ctl2-development-remains-a-rose-and-meghan-project?p=1182962#post1182962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Meghan Fitzgerald is still the Changeling: the Lost 2e developer. Rose and Meghan worked together to get the 2e core moving along and through the Kickstarter and now Meghan will continue as developer. Dixie will continue to work as editor and she is picking up some management side coordinating and high level CofD organizational duties.<br /> <br /> -M</div> </div> </div> </div> Cool thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-07T14:25:25-08:00","id":1183386,"title":"","content":"Yes. I'm stepping down from my full-time role with Onyx Path. I'll work with Meghan to put the finishing touches on the core (remember, it's written, developed, edited, and there's a good chunk of the art in). Meghan will continue to develop the supplements, as was always the plan.<br /> <br /> Dixie, although she's not getting my exact job at Onyx Path, will become the creative lead over Chronicles of Darkness, Exalted, and editing/indexing, as I was. Dixie will oversee Meghan's work, as well as that of all other developers working on CofD titles. Dixie was my top suggestion to succeed me in my post, and will do a fabulous job. (And she edited the CtL2 core.)<br /> <br /> I may do some more writing on the line, as my new work schedule permits.<br /> <br /> There is absolutely no reason to panic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 02-07-2018, 05:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T15:10:15-08:00","id":1184100,"title":"","content":"Cool, thanks for the update.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T11:40:59-08:00","id":1184461,"title":"","content":"Best of wishes on your new endeavors Rose! looking forward to seeing more of your writing in the future","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T04:28:16-08:00","id":1184694,"title":"","content":"Good luck for the future, then, Rose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","